# The repo root .gitignore has a Python-template `lib/` rule that also
# matches this project's src/lib/ (formatters/contrast utilities); un-ignore
# it explicitly. The directory itself must be negated before its contents,
# since git will not look inside an already-excluded directory.
!src/lib/
!src/lib/**
